d by  looking at their post history and  googling the reddit username you know I  think we can have a reasonable  conversation over whether this is  coercion or daxing or blackmail  what-have-you but to me it just comes  down to don't post offensive material on  the Internet under the guise of  anonymity and then try to blame the  victim but or try to play the victim  after that particularly after you take  responsibility for it no one forced him  to go on the donald subreddit and do  that so i think this sounds more like a  threat to Docs but barely because again  this information could have been found  by by by many people this is an adult  who outed themselves on the Internet  CNN is really not the problem here I do  think here's the problem with CNN this  is nonsense why is a news entity the  size and scope of CNN even looking for  the identity of this person and putting  out statements about the fact that  they've uncovered the identity if you  ever have have heard the term punching  down this is punching down see what I'm  embarrassed by here in for CNN is that  they even wasted time  don't even mention this guy right pat  that's my perspective don't get involved  in what some random person did on the  Internet don't give them the time of day  don't give them the satisfaction of  knowing that they seem to have gotten  under your skin don't waste time on this  and that's the real problem I have with  it it does seem as though  so they're trying to put themselves on  the same level as this reddit poster  where really they're broadcasting in so  many homes around the world that they're  far above him and it kind of plays into  this idea that you know maybe they are  fake news as Donald Trump opposes the  the mere involvement that they  participated in as a result of this only  fuels the fake news stuff from Trump and  the trumpets that have bought into it  hook line and sinker and that's why I  think it was just a total strategic  mistake by CNN

